      en: ["The first wooden church was established as early as 1208.", "Henry of Latvia authored the Chronicle of Henry of Livonia here.", "The current masonry church building was consecrated in 1739.", "The church houses an intricately designed Baroque altar.", "Archaeological digs confirmed settlements dating to the 13th century.", "Rubene is among the oldest Christian parishes in Latvia."],
