      hu: ["A palotát a híres olasz építész, Giacomo Quarenghi tervezte.", "Charlotte von Lieven, a cári gyermekek nevelőnőjének rezidenciája volt.", "Az építkezés öt évig tartott, és 1802-ben fejeződött be.", "A palotához tartozó park teljes területe 13 hektárt tesz ki.", "Az épület 1919-ben és 1944-ben is súlyos károkat szenvedett.", "Mežotne közvetlenül az ősi zemgal várdombbal szemben fekszik."],
      ro: ["Palatul a fost proiectat de celebrul arhitect Giacomo Quarenghi.", "A servit drept reședință pentru Charlotte von Lieven, guvernanta țarului.", "Construcția a fost finalizată în anul 1802, după cinci ani de lucru.", "Parcul palatului acoperă o suprafață totală de 13 hectare.", "Clădirea a suferit daune majore în anii 1919 și 1944.", "Mežotne se află chiar vizavi de cetatea istorică a zemgalilor."],
      en: ["The palace was designed by the famous architect Giacomo Quarenghi.", "It served as a residence for Charlotte von Lieven, the imperial governess.", "Construction was completed in 1802 after five years of work.", "The palace park covers a total area of approximately 13 hectares.", "The building sustained heavy damage in both 1919 and 1944.", "Mežotne is located directly across from an ancient Semigallian hillfort."],
